Variable System_per_Generatio
Title: System per Generation in use over time
Definition: Dynamic[Time](Horizon_Systems_per_, ~
	IF (System_Generation = 2019) ~
		THEN System_per_Generatio[@Time -1] * (1 - Upgrades_per_Year) ~
	ELSE ~
		Begin ~
			IF System_Generation > Time THEN 0~
			ELSE IF System_Generation = TIME ~
			THEN Sales_Volume + (System_per_Generatio[@Time -1][System_Generation=System_Generation-1] * Upgrades_per_Year)~
			ELSE (System_per_Generatio[@Time -1][System_Generation=System_Generation-1] * Upgrades_per_Year) + System_per_Generatio[@Time -1] * (1 - Upgrades_per_Year)~
		End)
